Fonts
-----

The fonts in `static/fonts/` are not ours. Saira and DotGothic16 are used
under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. Their licence texts are next to them, in
`static/fonts/OFL-Saira.txt` and `static/fonts/OFL-DotGothic16.txt`.

